{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だんだん過ごしやすくなってきてるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中\n今日は部屋の整理をしてたよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お見立て会の影アナの台本とか\nmeijiさんのCMの時のクリスマスレシピブックとか\n会いかもの歌割りとか\nぐるカーのミニ握の工程表とか\nおいシャンのMVの台本とか\n乃木坂浪漫の台本とか\nゆび祭りのヘビロテの立ち位置表とか\nHTC Jで台湾に行ったときの中国語のプリントとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんけん大会見てた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n見てないよ！\nJuice=Juiceさん見に行ってたから＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして台風の日の渋谷も\nJuice=Juiceさん見に行ってた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n当たり！\n今回のリリイベで行けたのは\nその2回だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\n本格的に占いを信じてしまう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日必ずチェックしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/09/21/8989851/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなの当たらない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか思ってても\n占いにすがりたくなるんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間って弱い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タロットがいいよ！当たる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の生ドルのさゆりんのお尻占いは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に信じない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/09/21/8989851/00